### Memo (`docs/memo/`)

Contains the LaTeX memo copy (`GTA-PS-memo-copy.tex`) compiled alongside the main
`GTA-PS-memo.tex` in the repo root.  The memo is the authoritative specification;
code is derived from it.

---

## Quick start

```bash
# Install (default stack: GARNET, FourRooms, MiniGrid, Reacher)
cd code/
python -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e ".[dev,reacher]"

# Smoke tests
pytest tests/test_smoke.py -q   # ~21 tests

# Quick RQ1 run
python experiments/rq1_proactiveness.py --env garnet --n-states 100 --seeds 20 --n-shifts 5

# Tune beta schedule before full run
python experiments/tune_beta.py
```

## Source layout

```
src/gta_ps/
├── algorithms/
│   ├── dp_agent.py      # DPAgent base class for VI-based planners
│   ├── dyna_agent.py    # Dyna-PS agent + CountModelLearner
│   ├── gta_ps.py        GTA-PS planner (all four variants)
│   ├── dyna_ps.py       Dyna-PS baseline
│   └── dyna_model.py    Count-based model learner (Dyna hosts)
├── envs/
│   ├── base.py          TabularEnv interface
│   ├── garnet.py        GARNET tabular MDP
│   ├── fourrooms.py     FourRooms grid (no gymnasium needed)
│   ├── reacher.py       Reacher-v5 discretised (Dyna host)
│   └── cargoal.py       CarGoal discretised (pinned stack)
└── utils/
    ├── spectral.py      Laplacians, SLEM, resolvents
    └── metrics.py       value_error_inf, steps_to_epsilon
```
